  choices = $EXPL$["Gift splitting allows $190,000 total ($19,000 x 2 donors x 5 donees) in outright gifts, and the 529 election provides no additional benefit","The 529 five-year election with gift splitting front-loads $950,000 into 529 plans using only annual exclusions, but if Thornton dies in Year 3, two-fifths of his share is included in his estate","The 529 five-year election caps at $95,000 per donor ($19,000 x 5 years) to a single beneficiary, limiting the couple to $190,000 total","Gift splitting is unavailable for 529 contributions because donor-owned accounts do not qualify as completed gifts for annual exclusion purposes"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
