  choices = $EXPL$["Separate returns are preferable because each subsidiary can optimize its own deductions and credits without consolidated return complexity","The consolidated return is preferable because Subsidiary B''s loss offsets A''s income and the intercompany gain is deferred, reducing current taxable income significantly","Consolidated returns never benefit the group because SRLY rules prevent subsidiary losses from offsetting parent or affiliate income","The results are identical because intercompany transactions are eliminated under both consolidated and separate return filings"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
